0708   F842             ;*                                                  Sample
0709   F842             ;* sum_t1_init 	Cycle Timer 1 Initial Value		$40
0710   F842             ;* sum_t2_init 	Cycle Timer 2 Initial Value		$01
0711   F842             ;* sum_t1_adder	Cycle Timer 1 Loop Adder		$00
